&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work closely with internal stakeholders, including Sales, Customer Success, and Analytics to maximize value and success for Forter’s strategic accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate effectively across time zones as part of a globally distributed team, including leadership based in the US.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
