&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience in a client-facing analytics, consulting, or professional services function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;SQL is required, plus proficiency in at least one of Python or R.&lt;/li&gt;
