&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We have a preference for New York based candidates, but are open to hearing from remote candidates throughout the United States (must be based on the East Coast).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
