&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Customer Success department is the backbone of everything Forter does, and as &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager of Customer Success&lt;/strong&gt; you&#39;ll lead a team responsible for our Strategic and Enterprise+ customers, our largest, most strategic logos. Forter&#39;s CS model is growth-focused and outcome-driven: your team doesn&#39;t just retain revenue, they own its expansion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
